    "SetSessionId is packed intpack on the wire, as are OnSessionId and OnResponseFor. Ping and SetSessionId share one authorized packet.",
    "Only a PingAck whose packet response context matches this Ping completes it; unmarked, stale and mismatching acknowledgements cannot confirm a replacement Ping.",
    "Peer aggregation: any fresh authoritative Online wins; Offline requires all usable contributions Offline; otherwise Unknown.",
    "Local classification permits one timely observed RTT plus 30 ms scheduling guard, capped at one configured tolerance. Late buffered acknowledgements receive no extra allowance.",
    "For All targets, soft Ping quarantine retains already confirmed presence promises until their ordinary deadline; hard quarantine and expiry still exclude them."
  ],
